Package: jatayu-driver-assistant
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, pciutils
Description: Graphical hardware and driver diagnostic assistant for JatayuOS
 Read-only PCI, USB, network, sound and Bluetooth hardware discovery
 with English and Hindi user interface and conservative recommendations.
 No driver installation, removal or repair is performed.
